+# Shadow role artwork
+
+`shadow-team.webp` is a transparent three-character atlas generated with the built-in image_gen tool on 2026-10-25. The user's attached Pi Shadow Mind illustration supplied visual inspiration. The left character represents requirements, the center represents evidence checking, and the right represents architecture. The images are decorative; names and textual progress convey every functional state.
+
+Regenerate the embedded client module with `node scripts/embed-shadow-art.mjs` after replacing the atlas. The client uses CSS background positioning to select each cell without making network requests.
+
+Generation prompt:
+
+> Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: one production character atlas for a software plugin UI. Reference image is style inspiration only: the three dark round shadow assistants. Create an original clean horizontal atlas containing exactly THREE separate full-body cute navy/slate round shadow mascots, evenly spaced in three equal square cells on a truly transparent background. Left character: a requirements inspector holding a small cream checklist, with warm peach accent. Center character: a fact checker holding a magnifying glass, with sky blue accent. Right character: an architecture reviewer holding geometric blueprint blocks, with lavender accent. Same soft grainy clay/paper illustration style as reference, simple tiny dark eyes and tiny mouth, subtle soft shading, rounded hands and feet, no text, no letters, no wordmark, no background scenery, no Pi logo or four-dot marks. Each character centered in its own cell, consistent size and height, generous transparent padding, silhouettes readable at 48px. Wide 3:1 composition. This is an asset atlas; no labels or borders.
